# The extra file's regex replaces the defaults file's (F15) and filters the
# table sections of both files: the defaults file's [`app`.`logs`] is dead.
-- options --
load-set: yes
-- defaults.cnf --
[mydumper]
regex=^app\.
[`app`.`logs`]
where=id>0
[`app`.`users`]
where=id>0
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
regex=^app\.users$
-- diagnostics --
(none)
on defaults.cnf:
3:2-3:14 info MDL509[table-group-not-dumped] app.logs does not match the regex ^app\.users$ (from input.cnf): mydumper never dumps it
  = The settings of this section never apply.
